<title>JAPAN: Japan November aluminium alloy output, shipments rise.</title>
<headline>Japan November aluminium alloy output, shipments rise.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's output and shipments of aluminium alloy rose in November from the same month a year ago, the Japan Aluminium Alloy Refiners Association said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The November data was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		   Nov 96	 yr/yr change	Oct 96</p>
<p> Output	  81,243	  +4.6 pct	   82,431</p>
<p> Shipments     83,009	  +6.3 pct	   82,302</p>
<p> Inventories   23,134	 -12.1 pct	   24,174</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
